ointed as syrian intelligence  colonel he was a man that trusted no one  in disliked cohen immensely so much so  that on Ellie's final trip to Israel he  asked that his assignment be terminated  but with the idea of having a spy in the  second-in-command position in Syria too  much to give up Ellie was sent back to  Syria where he would later be found  unbeknownst to Ellie Swede Annie had  stepped up efforts to find the mole  within their ranks and hired Soviet  experts with tracking equipment to  locate any illegal transmissions Ellie  was indeed caught in the act of sending  transmissions to Israel upon his capture  but perhaps the most infamous cameo in  the series are the bin Laden's  both Muhammad bin Laden and his son  mastermind of 9/11 Osama bin Laden who  is seen briefly here as a child  bin Laden Eden Elian is shipping hookups  to discreetly ship large pipes to be  used in an operation called shell out  whereby the Syrians would drain Lake  Tiberias cutting off Israel's access to  fresh water in my research I couldn't  find any mention of Chillon or Eli  Cohen's connection with bin Laden so the  extent to which this was dramatized in  the show has me questioning its veracity  but if you happen to know more I'd love  for you to comment below that's it for  this video I hope you learned a little  bit more about the characters in the  show and I want to hear your thoughts in  the comments and make sure to LIKE and  subscribe with that Belon for more  videos you can follow me on twitter at  think story whitey and until next time  remember daddy loves you very much
 

